#Method 1
docker run -it --name <containername> <Imagename or ImageID>
(-it represent the Interative Mode )







#To come out of the container 
1. ctrl+p+q  (To come of the coonntainer in the safe mode )
2. ctrl+d (It will kill the things inside the container , it is notrecommended )

